{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">findCodeQualitySource</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.MonadInfoTree\">Elab.MonadInfoTree</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.MonadFileMap\">MonadFileMap</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Source\">CodeQuality.Source</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Build a code-quality `Source` attributing `stx` to the declaration it belongs to\n(see `findMatchingDecl?`), falling back to the current module if no declaration matches. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource","kind":"def","line":106,"name":"Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L106-L112"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">findCodeQualitySource?</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.MonadInfoTree\">Elab.MonadInfoTree</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.MonadFileMap\">MonadFileMap</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/CodeQuality/Basic.html#Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Source\">CodeQuality.Source</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Build a code-quality `Source` attributing `stx` to the declaration it belongs to\n(see `findMatchingDecl?`), or `none` if no declaration matches. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource?","kind":"def","line":99,"name":"Lean.Linter.findCodeQualitySource?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L99-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findMatchingDecl?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">findMatchingDecl?</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.MonadInfoTree\">Elab.MonadInfoTree</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.MonadEnv\">MonadEnv</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Position.html#Lean.MonadFileMap\">MonadFileMap</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Find the declaration in the current file that `stx` belongs to.\n\nSearches the info trees of the current command for declarations (see `getNewDecls`) whose\ndeclaration range contains the range of `stx`, and returns the one whose range starts earliest.\nReturns `none` if `stx` has no position or no declaration's range contains it (e.g. for commands\nsuch as `#check` or `open`).\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.findMatchingDecl?","kind":"def","line":79,"name":"Lean.Linter.findMatchingDecl?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L79-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.getNewDecls\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">getNewDecls</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.InfoTree\">Elab.InfoTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Get the names of declarations introduced by elaborating `t`.\n\nA declaration introduces a `TermInfo` with `isBinder := true` whose `expr` is the constant\nbeing declared. This covers `def`/`theorem`/`axiom`, inductive types and their constructors,\nand structure fields and parent projections — including mutual blocks where each member\nemits its own binder.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.getNewDecls","kind":"def","line":62,"name":"Lean.Linter.getNewDecls","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L62-L77"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.getDeclsByBody\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">getDeclsByBody</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.InfoTree\">Elab.InfoTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Get the `parentDecl`s of every elaborated body in the infotree. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.getDeclsByBody","kind":"def","line":50,"name":"Lean.Linter.getDeclsByBody","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L50-L60"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.collectMacroExpansions?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">collectMacroExpansions?</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">range</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Syntax.html#Lean.Syntax.Range\">Syntax.Range</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">tree</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.InfoTree\">Elab.InfoTree</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Types.html#Lean.Elab.MacroExpansionInfo\">Elab.MacroExpansionInfo</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Go upwards through the given `tree` starting from the smallest node that\ncontains the given `range` and collect all `MacroExpansionInfo`s on the way up.\nThe result is `some []` if no `MacroExpansionInfo` was found on the way and\n`none` if no `InfoTree` node was found that covers the given `range`.\n\nReturn the result reversed, s.t. the macro expansion that would be applied to\nthe original syntax first is the first element of the returned list. ","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Util.html#Lean.Linter.collectMacroExpansions?","kind":"def","line":20,"name":"Lean.Linter.collectMacroExpansions?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Lean/Linter/Util.lean#L20-L48"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.InfoTree.Util","Lean.Elab.Term","Lean.Linter.CodeQuality.Basic","Lean.Linter.Init"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Linter.Util"}